  "title": "The Cigna Group Declares Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "BLOOMFIELD, Conn., July. 22, 2026 – The Board of Directors of The Cigna Group (NYSE: CI) today declared a cash dividend of $1.56 per share of its common stock, payable on September 23, 2026, to shareholders of record as of the close of business on September 8, 2026.",
